<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Spicer-Mitchell lifts interim shr, no div.</title>
<headline>Spicer-Mitchell lifts interim shr, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interim for 12 months ended Sept 30 vs year ended Sept 30, 1995</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr</p>
<p>    - attrib (cts)	    3.18	 vs     0.99 loss</p>
<p>    - headline		  6.37	 vs     14.37</p>
<p>    Attrib income	     1.75	 vs     0.32 loss</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		     4.38	 vs     3.59</p>
<p>    Tax			   2.11	 vs     1.10</p>
<p>    Interest paid	     4.91	 vs     2.85</p>
<p>    Turnover		  182.09	 vs     102.46</p>
<p>    Share of associates'    0.52	 vs     2.82</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 2.82	 vs     5.05</p>
<p>Full name: Spicer-Mitchell Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - These results represent an interim profit announcement as the year-end has been changed to December. The group declares dividends at the end of its financial year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
